{
  "an9.14:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 9.14 ",
  "an9.14:0.2": "2. Sīhanādavagga ",
  "an9.14:0.3": "Samiddhisutta ",
  "an9.14:1.1": "Atha kho āyasmā samiddhi yenāyasmā sāriputto tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā āyasmantaṁ sāriputtaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinnaṁ kho āyasmantaṁ samiddhiṁ āyasmā sāriputto etadavoca: ",
  "an9.14:2.1": "“Kimārammaṇā, samiddhi, purisassa saṅkappavitakkā uppajjantī”ti? ",
  "an9.14:2.2": "“Nāmarūpārammaṇā, bhante”ti. ",
  "an9.14:3.1": "“Te pana, samiddhi, kva nānattaṁ gacchantī”ti? ",
  "an9.14:3.2": "“Dhātūsu, bhante”ti. ",
  "an9.14:4.1": "“Te pana, samiddhi, kiṁsamudayā”ti? ",
  "an9.14:4.2": "“Phassasamudayā, bhante”ti. ",
  "an9.14:5.1": "“Te pana, samiddhi, kiṁsamosaraṇā”ti? ",
  "an9.14:5.2": "“Vedanāsamosaraṇā, bhante”ti. ",
  "an9.14:6.1": "“Te pana, samiddhi, kiṁpamukhā”ti? ",
  "an9.14:6.2": "“Samādhippamukhā, bhante”ti. ",
  "an9.14:7.1": "“Te pana, samiddhi, kiṁadhipateyyā”ti? ",
  "an9.14:7.2": "“Satādhipateyyā, bhante”ti. ",
  "an9.14:8.1": "“Te pana, samiddhi, kiṁuttarā”ti? ",
  "an9.14:8.2": "“Paññuttarā, bhante”ti. ",
  "an9.14:9.1": "“Te pana, samiddhi, kiṁsārā”ti? ",
  "an9.14:9.2": "“Vimuttisārā, bhante”ti. ",
  "an9.14:10.1": "“Te pana, samiddhi, kiṁogadhā”ti? ",
  "an9.14:10.2": "“Amatogadhā, bhante”ti. ",
  "an9.14:11.1": "“‘Kimārammaṇā, samiddhi, purisassa saṅkappavit